# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes
#
# * `env` is already in scope at all three call sites — each sits inside
#   `fetch(request, env, ctx)`. No plumbing beyond passing the argument.
#
# * `env ?? {}` guards the signature change: if any call site is missed, the
#   gate evaluates every flag as undefined, `isApproved` returns false, and the
#   noindex header is still applied. The failure mode is "stays private", never
#   "accidentally indexed".
#
# * If this file is TypeScript with a typed Env, widen the parameter to
#   `env: Partial<Env> | undefined` (or the project's existing Env type) rather
#   than leaving it implicit.
